<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<title>Our story — Marlow Street Bakery</title>
<meta name="description" content="How two bakers, a very old starter and an old print shop became Marlow Street Bakery.">
<meta property="og:title" content="Our story — Marlow Street Bakery">
<meta property="og:description" content="How two bakers, a very old starter and an old print shop became Marlow Street Bakery.">
</head>
<body>
{% render 'header' %}
<main>
<section class="bg-base-100 text-base-content">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 pt-12 pb-16 md:px-8 md:pt-20 md:pb-24">
    <p class="font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.25em] uppercase text-base-content/70" data-reveal>Since 2019</p>
    <h1 class="mt-6 text-[clamp(3.5rem,12vw,9rem)] leading-[0.82] font-extrabold tracking-tight uppercase" data-reveal>Our<br><em>story.</em></h1>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="bg-base-100 text-base-content">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl space-y-20 px-5 pb-20 md:space-y-28 md:px-8 md:pb-28">
    <div class="grid items-center gap-10 md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-16">
      <img src="/media/scored-crust.jpg" class="aspect-[4/5] w-full rounded-t-full rounded-b-box object-cover" data-reveal>
      <div data-reveal>
        <p class="font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.25em] uppercase text-base-content/70">2016</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 text-4xl leading-[0.9] font-extrabold uppercase md:text-6xl">A jar on a <em>windowsill.</em></h2>
        <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-pretty text-base-content/80">Maya mixed flour and water in a studio apartment and fed it every morning before work. A year later it raised a loaf she was proud of. That starter is the one in every loaf we bake today.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="grid items-center gap-10 md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-16">
      <div class="md:order-2"><img src="/media/baguettes.jpg" class="aspect-[4/5] w-full rounded-t-full rounded-b-box object-cover" data-reveal></div>
      <div data-reveal>
        <p class="font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.25em] uppercase text-base-content/70">2017 – 2018</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 text-4xl leading-[0.9] font-extrabold uppercase md:text-6xl">Two stalls, <em>side by side.</em></h2>
        <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-pretty text-base-content/80">Tom was selling croissants at the Saturday market, Maya her loaves at the next table. They swapped what was left at noon, then recipes, then a plan.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="grid items-center gap-10 md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-16">
      <img src="/media/shop-window.jpg" class="aspect-[4/5] w-full rounded-t-full rounded-b-box object-cover" data-reveal>
      <div data-reveal>
        <p class="font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.25em] uppercase text-base-content/70">2019</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 text-4xl leading-[0.9] font-extrabold uppercase md:text-6xl">214 Marlow <em>Street.</em></h2>
        <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-pretty text-base-content/80">The old print shop on the corner had high ceilings, a floor that could take an oven, and a window made for bread. We opened on a Tuesday at seven. There was a queue by ten past.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="bg-base-200 text-base-content">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 py-16 md:px-8 md:py-24">
    <p class="font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.25em] uppercase text-base-content/70" data-reveal>The team</p>
    <h2 class="mt-4 text-5xl leading-[0.9] font-extrabold uppercase md:text-7xl" data-reveal>Flour on <em>every apron.</em></h2>
    <ul class="mt-12 grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-4 gap-y-10 md:gap-x-6 md:gap-y-12 lg:grid-cols-4">
      {% for member in data.team %}
      <li data-reveal>
        {% if member.photo %}<img src="{{ member.photo }}" class="aspect-[4/5] w-full rounded-t-full rounded-b-box object-cover">{% else %}<div class="grid aspect-[4/5] w-full place-items-center rounded-t-full rounded-b-box bg-primary text-4xl font-extrabold text-primary-content uppercase md:text-6xl">{{ member.name | split: " " | first | slice: 0 }}{{ member.name | split: " " | last | slice: 0 }}</div>{% endif %}
        <h3 class="mt-5 text-xl font-extrabold uppercase md:text-2xl">{{ member.name }}</h3>
        {% if member.role %}<p class="mt-1 font-mono text-xs tracking-widest uppercase text-base-content/70">{{ member.role }}</p>{% endif %}
        {% if member.bio %}<p class="mt-3 text-sm text-pretty text-base-content/80 md:text-base">{{ member.bio }}</p>{% endif %}
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="bg-base-100 text-base-content">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-10 px-5 py-16 md:grid-cols-3 md:px-8 md:py-24">
    <div data-reveal>
      <p class="text-6xl font-extrabold uppercase md:text-7xl"><em>Slow.</em></p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-pretty text-base-content/80">Thirty-six hours for a loaf, three days for a croissant. Time does the work that additives would.</p>
    </div>
    <div data-reveal>
      <p class="text-6xl font-extrabold uppercase md:text-7xl"><em>Close.</em></p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-pretty text-base-content/80">Flour from a mill two hours north, milk and butter from the valley, fruit from the market across the street.</p>
    </div>
    <div data-reveal>
      <p class="text-6xl font-extrabold uppercase md:text-7xl"><em>Daily.</em></p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-pretty text-base-content/80">Nothing sits overnight. What is left at closing goes to the shelter on Fifth before the lights go off.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% render 'order' %}
</main>
{% render 'footer' %}
</body>
</html>
